      537         VIEW-AS TEXT
      538        SIZE 34.5 BY .67 NO-UNDO.
      539   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-1
      540        EDGE-PIXELS 3 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      541        SIZE 68 BY 2.25.
      542   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-2
      543        EDGE-PIXELS 3 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
      544        SIZE 68 BY 1.5.
      545   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-3
      546        EDGE-PIXELS 3 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
